   "detail": "Ported: ld a,[sObjectRemoveMode] / cp $02 / ret nz, then SCRY=$90, SCRX=$58, then $58F8 rewrites the record to anim 4 / sprite 9 with state/phase/type cleared. Console-verified by poking sObjectRemoveMode = 2 on the level 13 arena tape: the spawned child goes anim=0D fst=00 y=40 x=58 spr=0E -> anim=04 fst=00 y=90 x=58 spr=09 on the next frame; count goes 1 -> 2 as anim 4's state 0 spawns anim 5. Without the poke it is inert for 200+ frames. NOT the win gate - see boss_clear_ending_handoff."
